WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.566
"Sid!" Rex called.

2
00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:17.992
"Where are you?"

3
00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:20.661
Rex heard loud chomping.

4
00:00:20.662 --> 00:00:23.957
"Someone is over there," Rex said.

5
00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:28.132
He pointed toward some trees.

6
00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:31.320
The buddies walked past the trees.

7
00:00:31.321 --> 00:00:37.187
The chomping grew louder.

8
00:00:37.188 --> 00:00:41.675
The buddies found a berry patch.

9
00:00:41.676 --> 00:00:49.082
Sara smiled. "Those berries look sweet!"

10
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:50.900
Tor frowned.

11
00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:54.069
"I wish there were more berries.

12
00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:57.265
Somebody ate most of them."

13
00:00:57.266 --> 00:01:03.967
Chomp! Chomp! Chomp!

14
00:01:03.968 --> 00:01:07.055
Tor peeked around a bush.

15
00:01:07.056 --> 00:01:17.161
She saw Sid.

16
00:01:17.162 --> 00:01:19.975
"Sid!" Tor cried.

17
00:01:19.976 --> 00:01:24.550
"You're eating berries!"

18
00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.862
Sid stopped eating.

19
00:01:26.863 --> 00:01:30.445
"Uh-oh," he said.

20
00:01:30.446 --> 00:01:34.244
"You're not sick!" Rex said.

21
00:01:34.245 --> 00:01:40.639
"You tricked us!" Tor said.

22
00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:46.770
Sid gulped. "I'm sorry.

23
00:01:46.771 --> 00:01:55.439
Do you want berries too?"

24
00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:01.634
"Yes!" Rex, Sara, and Tor said.

25
00:02:01.635 --> 00:02:08.850
The four buddies ate berries.

26
00:02:08.851 --> 00:02:19.285
Sid ate too many.

27
00:02:19.286 --> 00:02:26.289
Later he felt sick.

28
00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:36.078
But nobody believed him.

